        "text": "Your Next Read",
        "text_sha256": "6d2b65f6bc74d3f3d5656d8c88c806ff70605a0ce9d4fd990efe9af093220755",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000037",
        "block_index": 37,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Is It Safe to Take Baths While You're Pregnant? Medically Reviewed by James Greenberg, M.D.",
        "text_sha256": "44e600fabcb74703fe3cf34a4c900ede9a3ed77424bb3b8fa9a64e7b8b782d20",
        "word_count": 15
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000038",
        "block_index": 38,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Which Spa Treatments Are Safe During Pregnancy? Here's What to Pick (and Skip) Medically Reviewed by Jennifer Wu, M.D., F.A.C.O.G.",
        "text_sha256": "c7ed41e181527d9bbae6694eb9d52001d2f0605b7d8e242fd807a28db56522d7",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000039",
        "block_index": 39,
        "block_type": "p",
